  "description": "YITAMOTOR factory-style headlights are identical to the original unit in every way— the same quality and same method of installation. And every headlight assembly undergoes strict testing before it leaves the factory. All wiring is rigorously tested to ensure the light is completely functional, and the housing is sealed with high-quality silicone to prevent any trapped moisture.\nFitment\n2001-2003 Honda Civic Sedan 4-Door Models(Not Compatible with 2-Door Coupe Models)\nProfessional installation would be highly recommended\nFeatures\nVehicle Compatibility - Headlight assembly compatible with 2001 2002 2003 Honda Civic Sedan 4-Door. High/low beam bulb type: 9003. Note: Bulbs and wiring harness are NOT included. Please verify your vehicle's model and year before purchase\nWaterproof– Fully sealed with solid silicone and equipped with one-way pressure-equalizing vents, the housing prevents moisture buildup and condensation\nEnhanced Brightness – The metallic parabolic reflectors optimize light output, delivering a broader, smoother, and more focused beam. Experience enhanced nighttime visibility and reduced eye strain for safer driving\nSide Safety Reflector – Built-in micro-prism reflectors on the sides make your vehicle highly visible to oncoming traffic and pedestrians at night. This passive safety feature ensures you are seen from all angles, reducing collision risks\nPlug-and-Play & All-Weather Versatility – Designed for direct OEM replacement with factory connectors, no cutting or special tools required. Ideal for daily commutes, off-road adventures, or extreme weather conditions",
